+// GIN Q4 (research build): collapsed CQ + CPU-proxy doorbell. DOCA's collapsed *blocking* poll
+// (doca_priv_gpu_dev_verbs_poll_cq_collapsed_at, used by the SQ-slot wait at every SQ wrap and by
